{"id":"n0edcec6f8f","headline":"Sensex, Nifty Extend Gains For Second Day, Rise 0.14% As Crude Oil Slips Below $73","summary":"Indian benchmark indices closed higher for a second straight session, rising 0.14%, supported by falling crude oil prices and positive global cues. Profit booking in IT and metal stocks erased most intraday gains.","why":"Crude oil prices affect India's import bill and inflation, which is why the Sensex and Nifty often react to oil moves.","category":"markets","event_type":"other","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Mumbai","country":"India","lat":19.08,"lon":72.88,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/sensex-nifty-extend-gains-for-second-day-rise-014-as-crude-oil-slips-below-73"},"sources":[{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/sensex-nifty-extend-gains-for-second-day-rise-014-as-crude-oil-slips-below-73"}],"published_at":"2026-06-25T10:51:48Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"b49e48103a08434d","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-06-25T10:51:48Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-06-25T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/stock-market-trading-screen-8575459.jpg","alt":"stock market trading screen (illustration)","credit":"PriismaDesign","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/man-drinking-whiskey-brandy-liquor-8575459/"}}